#: scenes/welcome/welcome.tscn
msgid ""
"Modules (*.gzmodule) change the editor and add functionality to the editor, "
"while GoZen Scenes (*.gzscene) are Godot scenes which can be used directly "
"in the timeline as visual clips/files. For creating these files, a bit of "
"development is needed inside a custom Godot project."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/welcome/welcome.tscn
msgid "Scene/module template"
